    "body": "Cause, by the commit range: this run gates c31384ae4, the merge of PR #3421 (#3300, the opening pose of a five-axis program). The run before it on 39ee81df5 is green. The three red tests are motion integration binaries (`multiaxis`, `multiaxis_avoid`, `multiaxis_rough`). The gate of PR #3421 and its trial merge ran the motion lib and `flow`, not these three binaries: that is the gap.\n\nA worker claims this issue now. Its first step is the panic text of each test, and then the decision for each: the product is wrong, or the test pins the old law that #3300 changed.\n\nFor authors of work on the same code (`crates/motion/src/multiaxis/stamp.rs`, `crates/post/src/post/mod.rs`), for example #3466: the fix of this issue can change the stamp rule of #3421 again. Wait for the PR of this issue before you build on that rule.\n",
