    "body": "All three tests fail at the inherited rapid pose assertion.\nThe actual value is Some([0.0, 0.0, 1.0]). The expected value is None.\n\nLocations before the correction:\n- multiaxis.rs:181: rapids_hold_the_pose_they_inherit.\n- multiaxis_avoid.rs:177: dodging_never_moves_the_ball.\n- multiaxis_rough.rs:162: rapids_and_floors_hold_no_pose_and_flanks_do.\n\nThe new opening pose assertions pass in all three tests.\nEach failure pins the old opening rule. PR #3421 intentionally states the upright pose before the first tilt.\nThe correction sets the expected initial pose to upright. It keeps each exact rapid inheritance comparison.\nThe stamp and the post need no change.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
